#: crispy_print/public/js/components/SettingsPane.vue:1266
msgid "1 field selected"
msgstr "1 campo seleccionado"

#. Content of the 'Typst Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Crispy Format'
#: crispy_print/crispy_print/doctype/crispy_format/crispy_format.json
msgid ""
"<div style=\"line-height:1.5;\">\n"
"  <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\">Typst Help</h4>\n"
"\n"
"  <div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>How Styling Works</strong>\n"
"    <ol style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px; padding:0;\">\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        In normal builder mode, <code>fieldLabelStyle</code>, <code>fieldValueStyle</code>, and <code>sectionLabelStyle</code> are configured in the Builder and automatically inserted before <code>typst_preamble</code>.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        <code>typst_preamble</code> runs before document content and can override global styles.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        <code>doc_header</code> defines <code>header_block</code>, and <code>doc_footer</code> defines <code>footer_block</code> for page header/footer setup.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        In Raw Typst mode, Crispy only injects document data and helper functions. Page setup, styling, header, footer, and layout belong in the Raw Typst code.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>Raw Typst Helpers</strong>\n"
"    <ol style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px; padding:0;\">\n"
"      <li>Document data is available as <code>#doc.fieldname</code>.</li>\n"
"      <li>Use <code>crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm)</code> and <code>crispy_block(\"document_title-v1.0\")</code> inside function arguments or other Typst expression contexts.</li>\n"
"      <li>When calling a helper directly from markup, add Typst's markup escape: <code>#crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm)</code> or <code>#crispy_block(\"document_title-v1.0\")</code>.</li>\n"
"      <li><code>crispy_image</code> resolves plain filenames only from the current site's private files assets.</li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>Quick Examples</strong>\n"
"    <ol style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px; padding:0;\">\n"
"      <li>Preamble: <code>#set text(font: \"Inter\", size: 11pt)</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Header: <code>#let header_block = [#text(weight: 700)[#doc.doctype]]</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Footer: <code>#let footer_block = [#text(size: 8pt)[#doc.name]]</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Raw placement: <code>#place(top + left, crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm))</code></li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div>\n"
"    <strong>Branding Layers</strong>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n"
"      In normal builder mode, the letterhead is rendered in the page <code>background</code>, while the logo and QR code are rendered in the <code>foreground</code> layer.\n"
"    </div>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"</div>"
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"line-height:1.5;\">\n"
"  <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\">Typst Help</h4>\n"
"\n"
"  <div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>How Styling Works</strong>\n"
"    <ol style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px; padding:0;\">\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        In normal builder mode, <code>fieldLabelStyle</code>, <code>fieldValueStyle</code>, and <code>sectionLabelStyle</code> are configured in the Builder and automatically inserted before <code>typst_preamble</code>.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        <code>typst_preamble</code> runs before document content and can override global styles.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        <code>doc_header</code> defines <code>header_block</code>, and <code>doc_footer</code> defines <code>footer_block</code> for page header/footer setup.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        In Raw Typst mode, Crispy only injects document data and helper functions. Page setup, styling, header, footer, and layout belong in the Raw Typst code.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>Raw Typst Helpers</strong>\n"
"    <ol style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px; padding:0;\">\n"
"      <li>Document data is available as <code>#doc.fieldname</code>.</li>\n"
"      <li>Use <code>crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm)</code> and <code>crispy_block(\"document_title-v1.0\")</code> inside function arguments or other Typst expression contexts.</li>\n"
"      <li>When calling a helper directly from markup, add Typst's markup escape: <code>#crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm)</code> or <code>#crispy_block(\"document_title-v1.0\")</code>.</li>\n"
"      <li><code>crispy_image</code> resolves plain filenames only from the current site's private files assets.</li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>Quick Examples</strong>\n"
"    <ol style=\"margin:6px 0 0 18px; padding:0;\">\n"
"      <li>Preamble: <code>#set text(font: \"Inter\", size: 11pt)</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Header: <code>#let header_block = [#text(weight: 700)[#doc.doctype]]</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Footer: <code>#let footer_block = [#text(size: 8pt)[#doc.name]]</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Raw placement: <code>#place(top + left, crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm))</code></li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div>\n"
"    <strong>Branding Layers</strong>\n"
"    <div style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n"
"      In normal builder mode, the letterhead is rendered in the page <code>background</code>, while the logo and QR code are rendered in the <code>foreground</code> layer.\n"
"    </div>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"</div><div estilo=\"altura-línea:1.5;\">\n"
"  <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;\">Ayuda Typst</h4>\n"
"\n"
"  <div estilo=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>Cómo funciona el estilo</strong>\n"
"    <ol estilo=\"margen:6px 0 0 18px; relleno:0;\">\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        En el modo de generador normal, <code>fieldLabelStyle</code>, <code>fieldValueStyle</code> y <code>sectionLabelStyle</code> se configuran en el generador y se insertan automáticamente antes de <code>typst_preamble</code>.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        <code>typst_preamble</code> se ejecuta antes del contenido del documento y puede anular los estilos globales.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        <code>doc_header</code> define <code>header_block</code> y <code>doc_footer</code> define <code>footer_block</code> para la configuración del encabezado/pie de página.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"      <li>\n"
"        En el modo Raw Typst, Crispy solo inyecta datos del documento y funciones auxiliares. La configuración de la página, el estilo, el encabezado, el pie de página y el diseño pertenecen al código Raw Typst.\n"
"      </li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div estilo=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>Ayudantes crudos Typst</strong>\n"
"    <ol estilo=\"margen:6px 0 0 18px; relleno:0;\">\n"
"      <li>Los datos del documento están disponibles como <code>#doc.fieldname</code>.</li>\n"
"      <li>Utilice <code>crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm)</code> y <code>crispy_block(\"document_title-v1.0\")</code> dentro de argumentos de función u otros contextos de expresión Typst.</li>\n"
"      <li>Cuando llame a un ayudante directamente desde el marcado, agregue el escape de marcado de Typst: <code>#crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm)</code> o <code>#crispy_block(\"document_title-v1.0\")</code>.</li>\n"
"      <li><code>crispy_image</code> resuelve nombres de archivos simples solo a partir de los activos de archivos privados del sitio actual.</li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div estilo=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n"
"    <strong>Ejemplos rápidos</strong>\n"
"    <ol estilo=\"margen:6px 0 0 18px; relleno:0;\">\n"
"      <li>Preámbulo: <code>#set text(font: \"Inter\", size: 11pt)</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Encabezado: <code>#let header_block = [#text(weight: 700)[#doc.doctype]]</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Pie de página: <code>#let footer_block = [#text(size: 8pt)[#doc.name]]</code></li>\n"
"      <li>Ubicación sin formato: <code>#place(top + left, crispy_image(\"logo.svg\", width: 20mm))</code></li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"\n"
"  <div>\n"
"    <strong>Capas de marca</strong>\n"
"    <div estilo=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n"
"      En el modo de creación normal, el membrete se representa en la página <code>background</code>, mientras que el logotipo y el código QR se representan en la capa <code>foreground</code>.\n"
"    </div>\n"
"  </div>\n"
"</div>"

